---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="About Us & Editorial Standards | Jabalpuriya.com"
  description="Learn about Jabalpuriya.com, our editorial mission, fact-checking guidelines, and dedicated coverage of Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-10 px-4 sm:px-6">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-[#0c1c33] rounded-3xl border border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 p-8 sm:p-12 shadow-xl space-y-8">
      
      <!-- Header -->
      <div class="border-b border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pb-6 space-y-2">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1 rounded-full text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-wider bg-jabalpur-secondary/10 text-jabalpur-secondary border border-jabalpur-secondary/20">
          Our Mission & Standards
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-slate-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight">
          About Jabalpuriya
        </h1>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-500 dark:text-slate-400 font-hindi">
          संस्कारधानी जबलपुर का स्वतंत्र डिजिटल मंच
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- About Content -->
      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed space-y-6 text-slate-700 dark:text-slate-300">
        
        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Who We Are</h2>
          <p>
            <strong>Jabalpuriya.com</strong> is a dedicated digital news portal and community platform headquartered in Jabalpur, Madhya Pradesh. Founded with the mission to connect the residents and global diaspora of <em>Sanskaardhani</em>, we provide real-time updates on civic development, Smart City projects, cultural heritage (such as Narmada Maha Aarti at Gwarighat and Bhedaghat tourism), higher education (RDVV, IIITDM), local businesses, and daily Vedic astrological predictions.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Editorial Guidelines & Fact-Checking</h2>
          <p>
            We adhere to strict editorial standards:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
            <li><strong>Accuracy & Verification:</strong> All news aggregated on our platform is cross-referenced with reputable national and state press agencies, municipal notices, and official government communiqués.</li>
            <li><strong>Source Transparency:</strong> Every article includes clear source attribution and a direct link to the original publication.</li>
            <li><strong>Brand Safety:</strong> We maintain a strictly moderated, brand-safe environment free of spam, unverified rumors, or offensive content.</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section class="space-y-3 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 pt-6">
          <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 dark:text-white">Get in Touch</h2>
          <p>
            Have a story lead, feedback, or a partnership inquiry? Reach out to our editorial team via our <a href="/contact" class="text-jabalpur-secondary underline font-semibold">Contact & Feedback Form</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>

      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-slate-200 dark:border-slate-800 text-center">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 rounded-xl font-bold text-sm bg-jabalpur-primary text-white hover:bg-jabalpur-secondary transition-all shadow-md">
          ← Back to Jabalpuriya Home
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
